From a84f0928b2d1a7221dce7b5d9993486385db46d4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zhymabek Roman <s.salkimbaev@abaiuniversity.edu.kz>
Date: Sun, 14 Jun 2026 15:33:56 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 3/9] twinapi.appcore/windows.ui: wire CoreWindow into
 FrameworkView.SetWindow

Run now creates a CoreWindow (windows.ui CoreWindowStatic.GetForCurrentThread)
+ CoreDispatcher and passes it to IFrameworkView_SetWindow. Adds minimal
ICoreWindow + ICoreDispatcher impls in dlls/windows.ui/corewindow.c.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
